<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">20092026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Iran has placed seven written conditions in Washington's hands, carried there by Qatari mediators.</s> <s>Security council figure Mohsen Rezaei named three of them aloud — end the war, release the frozen funds, lift the blockade — and since the sixty-day memorandum lapsed last month, the two capitals have exchanged strikes rather than terms.</s> <s>Qatar's no neutral postbox, though... it hosts American forces and shares a gas field with Iran, and that double stake is precisely what lets a channel survive a war.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Israel's president Isaac Herzog has erased the criminal record of Elor Azaria, the soldier who shot Abdel Fattah al-Sharif in the head as he lay wounded and immobilised on a Hebron street in two thousand sixteen.</s> <s>Azaria served nine months of an eighteen-month manslaughter sentence, and for a decade that single conviction was held up as proof that the military justice system polices its own.</s> <s>Erasing it removes the proof — the army itself objected, citing his lack of remorse, and al-Sharif's family is left with one judicial acknowledgement administratively withdrawn.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Saudi air defences intercepted a Houthi ballistic missile over Riyadh, the first strike on the capital since the truce of two thousand twenty-two.</s> <s>Eight years of missiles stopped with that truce, and this restarts the clock, reopening Yemen as a front of the wider war after the capture of Mokha and Perim Island and a declared blockade on Saudi shipping.</s> <s>The Houthis govern roughly two-thirds of Yemen's people and build their own weapons — they took Sanaa against Iranian advice — so no agreement struck in Washington or Tehran can quietly deliver the Bab el-Mandeb.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>American forces killed four more people on a boat in the Caribbean, bringing reported tallies to two hundred thirty-one dead across sixty-nine strikes in a year.</s> <s>Video was released — but no names, no nationalities, no charges, and no evidence of drugs, because interdiction, which used to mean stop, board, seize and prosecute, has been replaced by a lethal strike.</s> <s>One word does that work: calling the dead narco-terrorists converts suspects into combatants, and combatants don't have to be proven guilty of anything.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Akwa Ibom, Nigeria, families whose homes were bulldozed for a state medical city worth a hundred seventeen and a half billion naira have refused the compensation offered.</s> <s>Nduke Pious was offered five hundred fifty thousand naira for a bungalow she'd spent more than three million building, and independent valuers priced some of the demolished homes at up to seven times the state's figure.</s> <s>Compulsory acquisition compensates the assessed value of a structure, not the cost of rebuilding a life — the gap sits inside the law, and the state has not answered the families at all.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>The UN human rights office has documented widespread sexual violence by Russian forces in Ukraine since the full-scale invasion began, naming the responsible party rather than splitting the finding between sides.</s> <s>Its most-skipped finding concerns prisoners of war, because sexual violence against detained men is the form least likely to be counted anywhere, in any conflict.</s> <s>Verification of this kind isn't a statement of concern — it's the evidentiary substrate a future prosecution is built from, which makes every verified case a floor rather than an estimate.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Three students died at a high school in Banga, in South Cotabato on the Philippine island of Mindanao, two of them shot by a sixteen-year-old classmate who then killed himself.</s> <s>Mindanao carries one of the highest rates of civilian gun ownership in Asia, the residue of decades of insurgency, private armed groups, and a licensing regime that keeps regularising so-called loose firearms into ordinary households.</s> <s>So the question worth asking isn't whether school shootings have arrived — it's where a boy of sixteen found the weapon.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>American naval commanders say more than one billion barrels of crude have cleared the Strait of Hormuz under escort, while Iran's exports through it sit at zero.</s> <s>That's not a market clearing — it's a permission regime, a waterway where a navy decides which hulls pass, and Tehran calls the figure fabricated while neither claim can be independently checked.</s> <s>A permission regime gets billed through insurance and charter rates rather than the spot price, and the bill lands on the Asian buyers at the far end, with Brent touching a hundred thirty dollars and eighty cents this month.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India has given two hundred seventy-four million cooking gas households eleven days' notice: complete biometric Aadhaar authentication by the first of October, or lose the subsidised refill price.</s> <s>Officials say ninety per cent are already done and the aim is duplicate connections and commercial diversion — yet an anti-leakage measure that can't quantify the leakage is asking to be taken on trust.</s> <s>Biometrics fail in a pattern, not at random — worn fingerprints from manual labour, elderly claimants, patchy connectivity — so the households a filter like this sheds are the ones the subsidy exists for.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Pakistan's Jamaat-i-Islami sends protest caravans toward Islamabad from Sunday with a single demand: abolish the petroleum levy, which adds a hundred fourteen rupees of tax to every litre of petrol.</s> <s>Party chief Hafiz Naeemur Rehman has refused a relief package and won't call the march off, and a mass mobilisation carrying one fiscal ask is rare enough to be read as economics rather than protest.</s> <s>The levy sits outside the pool Islamabad shares with the provinces, so it's the one fuel tax the centre keeps whole — which is why an externally negotiated budget keeps reaching for it, and why letting go is harder than it sounds.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Fiji has declared a national HIV emergency: one adult in sixty is living with the virus, in a country of fewer than a million people.</s> <s>Only thirty-nine per cent of those infected know their status and just twenty-two per cent are receiving care, with two thousand new cases last year — sixteen times the figure from two thousand nineteen.</s> <s>Injected methamphetamine and shared needles drive it, and that curve behaves differently from the epidemics most national programmes were designed for: it moves fast through tight networks and outruns testing long before the data catches up.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Researchers say a mountain range raised by the assembly of Gondwana some six hundred million years ago, now buried beneath Antarctic ice, may have set the stage for complex life.</s> <s>The evidence is microscopic — zircon crystals whose chemistry records the crustal thickness of a range that no longer exists — and the argument runs that erosion on that scale flushed phosphorus and calcium into the ocean at rates the young Earth had never seen.</s> <s>Geology fertilised the sea, and the sea produced animals: the researchers say helped set the stage, not caused, and the difference is the whole discipline.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Donald Trump has called fears of artificial superintelligence a hoax and, in the same breath, announced an AI Force and a czar to run it, with no details offered.</s> <s>A state that believes the risk is fictional doesn't build a uniformed-sounding force against it, so the force is about industrial protection — he added that artificial intelligence might reach a quarter of American economic output, and he meets China's Xi Jinping next week.</s> <s>What nobody has said is which statute creates this thing, which budget line pays for it, or whether the czar is a confirmed office or an adviser who leaves with the president.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Four paying subscribers have sued four leading AI labs, alleging they illegally agreed to slow their own development.</s> <s>It's a strange accusation on its face — antitrust normally punishes firms for racing each other toward a harm, and this one says the harm was agreeing not to race, allegedly after Dario Amodei urged a slowdown and rivals said so publicly.</s> <s>A horizontal agreement among competitors to restrict output is illegal in itself, whatever the motive, which means we did it for safety isn't a defence the law recognises — and every voluntary safety pact in the industry runs through that same statute.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>